---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About IndieWiki" description="How IndieWiki is written, sourced, governed, and maintained." noIndex>
  <div class="reading-width">
    <section class="about-hero"><div class="page-kicker"><span class="kicker-line"></span> ABOUT THIS PROJECT</div><h1>Knowledge that stays useful.</h1><p>IndieWiki is a practical, contributor-maintained knowledge base for people building independent products: solo founders, indie hackers, and small teams.</p></section>
    <section class="about-section"><h2>Built as a wiki, not a brochure</h2><p>The GitHub repository is the source of truth. Articles are plain Markdown with structured metadata. A static build turns those files into the searchable website, so contributions can arrive through familiar issues and pull requests.</p></section>
    <section class="about-section"><h2>How an article gets made</h2><div class="about-steps"><div class="about-step"><span>01 / QUESTION</span><strong>Start with a real task</strong><p>Pick a specific problem a builder needs to solve.</p></div><div class="about-step"><span>02 / EVIDENCE</span><strong>Check the source</strong><p>Trace claims and note dates, context, and gaps.</p></div><div class="about-step"><span>03 / GUIDANCE</span><strong>Explain the trade-offs</strong><p>Turn research into steps a reader can adapt.</p></div><div class="about-step"><span>04 / REVIEW</span><strong>Improve it together</strong><p>Suggest corrections or additions in GitHub.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="about-section"><h2>Evidence is part of the page</h2><p>Articles distinguish source-backed facts, recommendations, experience, and open questions. Volatile details need a check date. A page's confidence label describes the support available, not a guarantee that it applies to every situation.</p></section>
    <section class="about-section"><h2>Contribute</h2><p>Small corrections are welcome. For a new guide, propose the reader question and source trail. Read the <a href="https://github.com/arunkumarkundra/indiewiki/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">contribution guide</a> and <a href="https://github.com/arunkumarkundra/indiewiki/blob/main/SOURCE_POLICY.md">source policy</a>.</p></section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
